Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:39:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1389/1463] HERESY 1431: the Security card's examples are
 nobody's network
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The examples were the Forge's own LAN (192.168.2.0/24), which make-release's scan refused for the public tree; they are 10.0.0.0/24 and 172.16.0.0/24 now (the asker's own network still comes from «+ my network»), in the card, the engine's answers and every language.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
